P21 follows a Human-in-the-Loop approach.

```text
AI Generates
        │
        ▼
Analyst Reviews
        │
        ▼
Knowledge Refined
```

Analyst responsibilities:

- validate functions
- validate ownership
- validate boundaries
- validate classifications

