## Benefits

### Faster Discovery

Large systems can be explored more quickly.

### Better Knowledge Transfer

Junior engineers can understand unfamiliar applications faster.

### Consistent Analysis

AI can apply the same discovery approach repeatedly.

### Legacy System Support

Particularly useful for:

- COBOL
- PL/I
- DB2
- Batch Applications
- CICS Applications

---

## Limitations

AI may:

- misunderstand business context
- infer incorrect ownership
- merge unrelated functions
- miss implicit business rules

Results should always be reviewed by domain experts.

