## Relationship to P21

AI-assisted FPA supports the primary P21 objective:

> Learn how to understand unknown systems.

The focus is not on automated estimation.

The focus is on accelerating:

- application understanding
- dependency discovery
- business capability mapping
- impact analysis
- modernization preparation
- knowledge transfer

---

## Key Takeaway

AI-assisted Function Point Analysis combines traditional functional analysis with modern AI capabilities.

The result is a structured and scalable approach to understanding enterprise applications, especially in large legacy environments where documentation is incomplete and 
system knowledge is distributed across multiple teams.
